    },
    "inputs.prior_findings": {
      "optional": true,
      "description": "The previous pass's findings AND what the author did with each, so the loop converges instead of rediscovering the same weakness. A `blocked` disposition is the author saying it cannot see how to make progress — judge it, and raise `target: 'ask'` where it is right."
